{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16917","headline":"津梁寺采新茶与幕中诸公遍赏芳香尤异因题四韵兼呈陆郎中 · 武元衡","name":"津梁寺采新茶与幕中诸公遍赏芳香尤异因题四韵兼呈陆郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灵州碧岩下，荑英初散芳。\n涂涂犹宿露，采采不盈筐。\n阴窦藏烟湿，单衣染焙香。\n幸将调鼎味，一爲奏明光。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16917.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16917","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}